Package: llm-manager-remote-helper
Version: 0.1.0~dev0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: LLM-Manager contributors
Depends: python3 (>= 3.14), python3-cryptography (>= 46.0.5), sudo
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: restricted remote recovery helper for LLM-Manager
 Root-owned helper for encrypted recovery copies on an SSH-managed host.
 This package is intentionally separate from the local LLM-Manager package.
